user_report: When attempting to call predict() against a Space using @gradio/client in Node.js, the process crashes with an unhandled promise rejection rejecting with reason "#<Object>". Inspecting the failure shows an underlying TypeError indicating "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'map')".

TRACEBACK:
node:internal/process/promises:288
            triggerUncaughtException(err, true /* fromPromise */);
            ^

[UnhandledPromiseRejection: This error originated either by throwing inside of an async function without a catch block, or by rejecting a promise which was not handled with .catch(). The promise rejected with the reason "#<Object>".] {
  code: 'ERR_UNHANDLED_REJECTION'
}

