user_report: Using the voice assistant with OpenAI conversation and HA-MCP server tool search fails with an invalid schema error after upgrading. The error specifically reports that True is not of type number within the function schema parameters.

TRACEBACK:
2026-09-04 18:49:09.499 ERROR (MainThread) [homeassistant.components.openai_conversation] Error talking to OpenAI: Error code: 400 - {'error': {'message': "Invalid schema for function 'ha-mcp-server-tool-search__ha_search': True is not of type 'number'.", 'type': 'invalid_request_error', 'param': 'tools[17].parameters', 'code': 'invalid_function_parameters'}}
